          "id": "personal-v2-home-015",
          "block_type": "callout",
          "title": "Read the case study",
          "content": "The problem\n\nStudios were maintaining separate project boards and weekly schedules that routinely fell out of sync. A revised deadline could leave someone working from an obsolete plan.\n\nDesign and delivery\n\nI built scheduling around the existing task record, keeping ownership and review status visible throughout. After testing with three studio teams, I delivered a component library covering keyboard behaviour and empty states.",
          "presentation": {
            "span": "full",
            "role": "body",
            "variant": "note",
            "group": "personal-v2-home-group-3"
          }
        },
