          "id": "personal-v2-home-021",
          "block_type": "callout",
          "title": "Read the case study",
          "content": "Scope and priorities\n\nThe initial catalogue records each book’s owner, availability, and borrower. Ratings and reviews were outside the brief: the group needed a reliable lending record.\n\nDesigning for use at meetings\n\nI designed the mobile flow around the point of borrowing, with availability prominent and a short form that members can complete during a meeting. Recommendations can be added when a book is returned.",
          "presentation": {
            "span": "full",
            "role": "body",
            "variant": "note",
            "group": "personal-v2-home-group-4"
          }
        },
